<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Dec 4 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Dec 4 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 27</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............776,200 up.....8,000</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...711,200 up.....6,100</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......469,900 down.....500</p>
<p> ONE WEEK ENDED DECEMBER 4</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....769,446 up.....4,148</p>
<p> Financial companies.......587,190 up.....6,624</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,495 up.........5</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,239 up........36</p>
</text>
